    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρσολοπ-εύω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρσολοπ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>irritate, provoke,</i> c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ με βοῶν ἕνεχ᾽ ὧδε χολούμενος
			ὀρσολοπεύεις</span>; <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				308
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρσολοπεύει μύθῳ ὀνειδείῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
					107
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρσολοπεῖται θυμός</span> my
			heart <i>is troubled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				10
			</span></i> (anap.).</div>
